const home=`<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Eagle 4K · streaming membership</div><h1>Choose your<br><em>clearer view.</em></h1><p>Eagle 4K is a straightforward place to explore single-connection subscriptions, reseller credit plans and practical setup guidance.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/subscriptions/">View subscriptions</a><a class="button ghost" href="/apps-setup-guides/">Explore setup guides</a></div><div class="signal">● CONTENT · DEVICE · NETWORK — ALL SHAPE 4K AVAILABILITY</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Every screen counts</div><h2>Made for the way you watch.</h2><p class="lede">Use the subscription view to compare the four available durations, or go straight to a tailored order message. No multi-connection offers and no confusing price ladders.</p></div><div class="devices" aria-label="TV and phone device previews"><div class="device tv"></div><div class="device phone"></div></div></div></section><section class="wrap grid"><article class="card"><div class="eyebrow">01 / subscribe</div><h3>One connection, four choices</h3><p>From €10 for one month to €45 for a year.</p><a href="/subscriptions/">See subscriptions →</a></article><article class="card"><div class="eyebrow">02 / resell</div><h3>Credits with a clear unit</h3><p>12 credits equal one year for one connection.</p><a href="/reseller/">See reseller plans →</a></article><article class="card"><div class="eyebrow">03 / set up</div><h3>Practical guidance</h3><p>Find device preparation steps before you begin.</p><a href="/apps-setup-guides/">Read guides →</a></article></section>`;
