const reseller=`<section class="pagehead"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Eagle 4K reseller plans</div><h1>Credits for annual Eagle 4K subscriptions.</h1><p class="lede">Our reseller plans use a clear credit system for Eagle 4K one-connection subscriptions: 12 credits provide one year for one connection. That means 120 credits cover ten annual subscriptions.</p></div></section><main class="wrap plans"><article class="card"><h2>120 credits</h2><div class="price">€85</div><p>A practical starting package for supplying ten annual, one-connection Eagle 4K subscriptions.</p><a class="button" href="${order('120 reseller credits','€85')}">Ask on WhatsApp</a></article>${[240,600,1200].map(x=>`<article class="card"><h2>${x} credits</h2><div class="price">Contact sales</div><p>Contact sales to discuss this Eagle 4K reseller package and the subscription needs of your customers.</p><a class="button ghost" href="https://t.me/premiumiptvpanelscom">Contact sales</a></article>`).join('')}</main><section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">How credits work</div><h2>One simple subscription unit.</h2><p class="lede">Each annual Eagle 4K subscription for one connection uses 12 credits. Reseller credits are designed for sellers who need to plan annual subscriptions clearly, without offering additional connections or connection discounts.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Need a personal subscription instead?</h3><p>For individual viewing, Eagle 4K offers four one-connection subscription durations: 1, 3, 6 or 12 months.</p><a class="button ghost" href="/subscriptions/">View subscriptions</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><h2>Larger reseller packages</h2><p class="lede">For 240, 600, 1200 credits or a larger Eagle 4K reseller package, contact sales on <a href="https://wa.me/212670779271">WhatsApp</a> or <a href="https://t.me/premiumiptvpanelscom">Telegram</a>.</p></div></section>`;
