const guides=`<section class="pagehead"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Apps & setup</div><h1>Start with the device in front of you.</h1><p class="lede">Eagle 4K setup guidance is intentionally general until you have your subscription details. Keep your device updated and use a stable network.</p></div></section><main class="wrap grid"><article class="card"><h3>Smart TV</h3><p>Open your TV’s app store, install your preferred compatible player, then enter the subscription information supplied after purchase.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Mobile & tablet</h3><p>Install a compatible player from your device’s official app store. Use a current OS version and avoid sharing your login.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Streaming device</h3><p>Update the device first, install a compatible player, and enter your supplied details carefully. A wired connection can improve stability.</p></article></main><section class="section"><div class="wrap faq"><h2>Before you begin</h2><details><summary>Will every title be in 4K?</summary><p>Not necessarily. 4K availability depends on the content, your device’s capability and the quality of your network connection.</p></details><details><summary>Where do I get login details?</summary><p>Contact sales after choosing your package. They will provide the information relevant to your order.</p></details><details><summary>Need setup help?</summary><p>Contact <a href="https://wa.me/212670779271">WhatsApp</a>, <a href="https://t.me/premiumiptvpanelscom">Telegram</a>, or <a href="mailto:support@reselleriptv.com">email support</a>.</p></details></div></section>`;
